{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "682310ac04dc06dc5acce3311d4460a9270de84fd32bc71e285a540792979347", "ja": "トラブルを乗り越え、ふたりの絆は\nより強まった！　後は最高のステージに\nするだけ……劇場公演に挑もうとする、\nロックなアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "克服了重重困难，两人的羁绊变得更加牢固！接下来只要打造出最棒的舞台就行了……这是摇滚偶像们准备挑战剧场公演时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6191d046dc0f1feb081783f8b895acde86c1428a1555bb07e45afeee3bf25935", "ja": "（今日はジュリアと麗花の劇場公演。この日のため、\n事前に海外に出かけ宣伝PVを撮影済みなのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是茱莉亚和丽花的剧场公演。为了这一天，之前已经去海外拍摄了宣传PV，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "87657564e13fb0753060e882e6e93ffeab74f8600951ad0c8b8b006019a742b3", "ja": "さーて、いよいよ劇場公演……。\nPV撮影から始まった、ウチらのステージ本番だな！", "zh": "那么，终于要开始剧场公演了……  \n从拍摄PV开始筹备的咱们的舞台，终于要正式上演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "79fd36d5d373c045ed27e10ef6a6465d0ca4bfd10d393920188f72727091af75", "ja": "撮影旅行も楽しかったね、ジュリアちゃん！\n荒野をドライブしたり、荒野でエンストしたり♪", "zh": "拍摄之旅也很开心呢，茱莉亚！\n在荒野上兜风，还在荒野上抛锚了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "42296c5e2f12245587e38b1a0639da9c8c12b4e3591df15955fe48a76715565c", "ja": "エンストはさすがに焦ったけどな……。\nったく、レイと一緒だとホント退屈しないぜ。", "zh": "发动机熄火时确实让我慌了一下……\n真是的，和丽一起就真的不会无聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "66728ae177318cb8f018c37032155a6c8cd700818a12acfc61e3db15f9dc0e8a", "ja": "えっへん♪　でも私もジュリアちゃんと一緒だと、\n全然ちっとも退屈しないよ？", "zh": "得意吧♪ 不过和茱莉亚在一起，我也一点都不会觉得无聊哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "f0560f3da5855a02d3a1e84aec252627b703560d2bb68c7534a6d210d89345e7", "ja": "まあ、あの時は電話越しの誰かさんも、\n退屈どころか絶句してたけどな♪", "zh": "不过，那时候电话另一头的某个人别说无聊了，简直都惊呆了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "dac6e2caba97b53509fc2d3800e4e040f23957b451fad0896e635605e5410ca0", "ja": "当たり前だろ……車で出かけたアイドル二人が、\n外国の荒野のど真ん中に放り出されたんだから。", "zh": "那当然会这样啊……毕竟开车外出的两名偶像，\n可是被扔在了外国荒野的正中央啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "0525b889f023ddafb311dbfc7ddba605b495babd9f97b3bc62a30fd3b8e93646", "ja": "あははっ、悪かったって。でも、なんだかんだで\n戻って来れたんだ。結果オーライってことで！", "zh": "啊哈哈，好啦是我不对。不过，最后不也\n平平安安回来了嘛。结果好不就万事大吉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "66d6b6324178fca213be36bb9c97e232ea60a8100aa2b2f37e1a45efc05969ed", "ja": "二人で街に帰る旅も楽しかったね、ジュリアちゃん！\n歌ったり踊ったり、歩いたり座ったり♪", "zh": "我们俩一起回城的旅程也很开心呢，茱莉亚！唱歌跳舞，走走坐坐的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0393123609fa140a9b946b7e56d699d397c75e0a11ff32c3ce5bd4d1a67a3419", "ja": "とにかく、無事に終わって本当に良かった……。\nいま不安なのは、もうこの後の本番のことだけかな。", "zh": "总之，能平安结束真是太好了……\n现在感到不安的，就只剩下接下来的正式演出了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "f8c0aa1fa5a42cdfead4f07f4e223b231c11075ceba9beb7f220593577e9b604", "ja": "ん？　ウチらのステージなら……\nそれこそ余計な心配じゃないか。なあ、レイ？", "zh": "嗯？要是我们的舞台的话……\n那根本就是多余的担心吧。对吧，丽？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "6d95e80d99c87651d2d24e71e62d75288a5c24be3248c844fff273afb4eca445", "ja": "はい♪　旅の間中、ジュリアちゃんとずーっと一緒に\nいましたから、息もピッタリ、歌もピッタリです♪", "zh": "是的♪ 旅途中一直和茱莉亚在一起，配合默契，歌声也很合拍♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "1aeb8941c014fa8959f7b5cccf87f9cd67cadcc75488b262ff0a2d01b44f2c67", "ja": "ま、別にあらためて仲良くなったとか、\nそんなんじゃないけどさ。ただ……。", "zh": "也没什么特别重新变亲近啦，才不是那回事。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "4910383a69c5234629ee6aef79e6d71685df6e6e0c7a58bb98236df35d8ca30a", "ja": "今のあたしなら今まで以上に、レイの歌に\n乗っていける。……ま、そんな感じだ！", "zh": "现在的我，能比以前更好地跟上丽的歌了。……嗯，大概就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "1af905b33ece01db7c9c1643b4af89ec52b6a0ea2d0773e4dad0c06082176c9a", "ja": "ではライドオン！　さんぼわさんぼ、わさんぼーん♪\nジュリアちゃんも一緒に、わさんぼーん♪", "zh": "那么，骑上来！桑波哇桑波，哇桑波——♪\n茱莉亚也一起来，哇桑波——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "8bb22bd1f9a6a4267ce2b42c9ee8f56b4ba585c33865da35317a33cc418c13d2", "ja": "えっ！？　さ、さんぼ、わさん……\nいや何だよ急に！？", "zh": "诶！？　桑、桑波……哇桑……\n不是，你突然干什么啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "689b1f4a0d8c7a713fb392a2407f94e6bc22e6c7bbc298cb94b438eba7c2f605", "ja": "パチパチパチ～。\nどうですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啪啪啪～。\n怎么样，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "73cf062f2e013aef08b48b8503efefb4e6542872cb9e06d1f7b626b9f6551500", "ja": "どうですかじゃないだろ！　{$P$}、\n今のは違うからな。大丈夫、普通に歌えるから！", "zh": "才不是问“怎么样”吧！{$P$}，刚才那个不算！没事，我正常唱得出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd038762acc3587413f657f42578b057bbd0333ca208248506fb9d4d8837f5c8", "ja": "わかってるって。そもそも心配してるわけじゃないし。\n不安だって言ったのは、ただ……。", "zh": "我知道啦。说到底，我又不是在担心。说自己不安，也只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bff38821272b7d2844ba4c9e2b671a6837f3ed559e9f358b154f77ea43b50ef2", "ja": "ずっと準備してきた二人が、どこまでスケールアップ\nしてるのか。それを確かめるのが怖いってだけなんだ！", "zh": "我只是害怕确认，一直以来都在准备的两个人，究竟已经成长到了什么程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e6db7956e698ed83ab0f662007889c71df3d6be8a71fa32a44a4243b78d8621", "ja": "はーん、なるほど。要するに、\n生半可なステージは見せるなってコトか。フフッ。", "zh": "哈——原来如此。也就是说，别拿半吊子的舞台给我看，对吧。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "04da7a455295226620e028ed436b81fa6c6c052254c8a57a48dd7feb478e7750", "ja": "レイ、{$P$}がなんか\nロックなこと言ってるけど。どうする？", "zh": "丽，你看，{$P$}好像说了些摇滚的话。怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "ffb2f493dd496ad0015730542169b547d1e1b2b50ffbb93b57dbf7920591e12f", "ja": "じゃあ私もロックに、ステージからかっこよく\nダイブしますね！　ぎゅいいーん！", "zh": "那我也摇滚一点，帅气地从舞台上跳下来吧！咻——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "45ec52e145050d8e45874944e5b69b7f069070914cfbaeae6a2c52bd0dc3a82d", "ja": "あははっ、そりゃロックでいいな。でも……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，那确实够摇滚的，挺不错嘛。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "1dffc21d545afbdc0b1aec21657642237726eddb6a1b19b10a34b4f74344cade", "ja": "うん、その前に私とジュリアちゃんのステージで！\nお客さんの心に、思いっきりダイブしようね！", "zh": "嗯，在那之前先用我和茱莉亚的舞台！\n痛痛快快地跳进观众们的心里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "3d4e1a8adee73b4614d6abdd7c27d419ad748000a4183c884edc802cd1b270ea", "ja": "OK！　まずはウチらの歌で、客席に大波を起こす！\n話はそれからだ！", "zh": "OK！首先用咱们的歌声，在观众席掀起滔天巨浪！\n剩下的之后再说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1028_audience", "source_sha256": "e8f4c2eb991cf19ff8c25748162ff4e88d268c661e4327ed3eb2a81e003e0f06", "ja": "（ワアアアア……！！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊啊……！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "eb57362a5f4fb8ea3609c5fa489b7efcd25ca48cac9494fe41ba7b621019a1a7", "ja": "わぁ♪　お客さんも、もう待ちきれないみたい！\nじゃあ行ってきますね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "哇♪　观众们好像也已经等不及了呢！\n那我上台咯，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_112_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_112_fc_01_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "4266c0f3a7ef7fbecf32c171ee5d093d363bc81dfd5413dc6e9cb7aff5d02465", "ja": "んじゃ、始めるか。レイとあたしの……\nウチらにしかできない、ロックステージの開幕だ！", "zh": "那就开始吧。丽和我的……\n只有我们才能做到的摇滚舞台，开幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
